    "type": "game",
    "name": "In the Wild",
    "steam_appid": 1575380,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the Wild</strong> is an educational game where you play as real forest animals, roam a beautiful island, and collect fact orbs to learn real-world facts about the animals you control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1575380/extras/adfe8060820deba825d8f87941148105.avif?t=1749108021\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Learn Through Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each animal has its own set of unique facts scattered across the island.  <br>Find them, collect them, and our in-game guide will display the fact and read it aloud to you - teaching you something new with every discovery.  <br> <br>With hundreds of facts scattered across the island, there's plenty to explore and learn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Original Soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the atmosphere of the island with our custom soundtrack, composed by WesWolf Productions to perfectly complement the game's beautiful environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic Time &amp; Weather</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our dynamic time and weather system enables an additional layer of interaction with the world. As a player, you can choose to use real-world time (relative to their time-zone) or our in-game time.\u00a0<br><br>Want clear skies all the time? You also have the ability to disable weather entirely. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How you play is completely up to you.   <br><br>Escape into nature and enjoy your time <strong>In the Wild</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1575380/extras/f6a44e48702171fb354e4b2e7cbc1b14.avif?t=1749108021\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the Wild</strong> is an educational game where you play as real forest animals, roam a beautiful island, and collect fact orbs to learn real-world facts about the animals you control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1575380/extras/adfe8060820deba825d8f87941148105.avif?t=1749108021\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Learn Through Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each animal has its own set of unique facts scattered across the island.  <br>Find them, collect them, and our in-game guide will display the fact and read it aloud to you - teaching you something new with every discovery.  <br> <br>With hundreds of facts scattered across the island, there's plenty to explore and learn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Original Soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the atmosphere of the island with our custom soundtrack, composed by WesWolf Productions to perfectly complement the game's beautiful environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic Time &amp; Weather</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our dynamic time and weather system enables an additional layer of interaction with the world. As a player, you can choose to use real-world time (relative to their time-zone) or our in-game time.\u00a0<br><br>Want clear skies all the time? You also have the ability to disable weather entirely. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How you play is completely up to you.   <br><br>Escape into nature and enjoy your time <strong>In the Wild</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1575380/extras/f6a44e48702171fb354e4b2e7cbc1b14.avif?t=1749108021\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Play as wild animals in a relaxing open-world island. Discover hundreds of glowing orbs that teach you real-world facts about the animals you control. With dynamic weather, day/night cycles, and narrated facts, In the Wild is a peaceful way to explore and learn.",
